                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>Irabel enters a stance wherein she adopts a fluid, sinuous set of motions that mimic the striking of a venomous serpent. Her fist Strikes deal piercing damage while she's in Asp Stance, and she gains a +1 circumstance bonus to AC. When she targets the same creature with two Strikes from her Flurry of Blows, if both Strikes hit, the target becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 1} from the pain.</p>"
                },
